<details>
  <summary>What's the difference between Free and Pro?</summary>
  <p>Free includes highlighting, the full library, search, iCloud sync, Markdown copy, Spotlight, and Shortcuts. Pro adds AI Access — compatible AI tools on your Mac can search and read your highlights — and on-device AI context.</p>
</details>
<details>
  <summary>Is Pro a subscription?</summary>
  <p>No. Pro is $4.99, paid once. It's an in-app purchase through the App Store, not a subscription.</p>
</details>
<details>
  <summary>Why would I pay for Pro?</summary>
  <p>If you use compatible AI tools on your Mac, Pro lets them answer from what you've actually read and cite the source through a local, read-only connection. The tool handles what it reads under its own policy. If you don't use AI tools, the free version may be all you need.</p>
</details>
